<title>SWITZERLAND: CS Holding sells Watt stake.</title>
<headline>CS Holding sells Watt stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS Holding said on Friday it and a German group have formed a consortium to take over CS Holding's stake in Watt AG, the energy unit of Elektrowatt AG.</p>
<p>As a next step, the consortium will make an offer to the public shareholders of Elektrowatt.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
